WEBVTT
X-TIMESTAMP-MAP=MPEGTS:900000,LOCAL:00:00:00.000

STYLE
::cue(.italic) { font-style:italic }

62
00:02:56.944 --> 00:03:01.281 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle
向左，最后一次，出拳。再回到屈髋动作。

63
00:03:01.381 --> 00:03:04.051 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle
双脚略窄于髋宽，双手放在大腿前。

64
00:03:04.151 --> 00:03:06.987 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle
屈髋，脊柱延展，双手向头顶方向伸展，

65
00:03:07.321 --> 00:03:08.388 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle
站直。

66
00:03:09.289 --> 00:03:10.490 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle
屈髋，脊柱延展。

67
00:03:10.624 --> 00:03:14.862 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle
记住，我们是在为接下来的训练做好准备。

68
00:03:15.229 --> 00:03:16.830 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle
接下来会有屈髋、

69
00:03:17.698 --> 00:03:22.436 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle
深蹲、转体和划船，

70
00:03:22.636 --> 00:03:25.572 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle
所以现在要让身体准备好。

71
00:03:25.806 --> 00:03:27.508 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle
起身。来吧。

72
00:03:27.708 --> 00:03:30.477 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle
再来一次。屈髋，脊柱延展。

73
00:03:30.744 --> 00:03:32.946 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle
起身，站直。［欢呼］

74
00:03:33.080 --> 00:03:34.181 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle
［欢呼］

75
00:03:34.548 --> 00:03:39.152 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle
伙伴们，用20分钟力量训练点亮活动圆环，

76
00:03:39.620 --> 00:03:41.455 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle
这些灯光也会为我们闪耀。

77
00:03:41.555 --> 00:03:42.990 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle
继续动起来。

78
00:03:43.090 --> 00:03:47.594 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle
拿起一只哑铃，举到胸前正中。

79
00:03:47.895 --> 00:03:50.230 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle
双肘收紧，双脚与髋同宽。

80
00:03:50.330 --> 00:03:52.733 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle
我们做高脚杯深蹲。屈膝，

81
00:03:52.833 --> 00:03:55.035 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle
臀部向脚跟方向下沉，

82
00:03:55.169 --> 00:03:57.838 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle
然后重新起身站直。

83
00:03:57.971 --> 00:03:59.540 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle
跟着 Kym 就缩小动作幅度。

84
00:03:59.640 --> 00:04:01.275 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle
来，向下。［欢呼］

